    {
      "line_id": "P1L020",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "4.2023年11月30日，神舟十六号载人飞船返回舱在东风着陆场成功着陆，航天员景海鹏、朱杨柱、桂海潮顺利出舱。在其返回过程中，下列说法正确的是（",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L021",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "A.研究返回舱运行轨迹时，可将其视的质点",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L022",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "B.减速过程中，返回舱对宇航员的作用力一定逐渐减小",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L023",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 23,
      "text": "C.返回舱落地前，反推发动机点火减速，宇航员处于失重状态",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L024",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 24,
      "order": 24,
      "text": "D.利用返回舱的轨迹长度和返回时间，可计算其平均速度的大小",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L025",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 25,
      "order": 25,
      "text": "5.如图所示，在固定斜面上不同位置同时由静止释放两个质量不同的滑块。若两滑块与斜面间动摩擦因数相同，则它们在下滑过程中（）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L026",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 26,
      "order": 26,
      "text": "A.距离越来越近",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L027",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 27,
      "order": 27,
      "text": "B.距离越来越远",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L028",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 28,
      "order": 28,
      "text": "C.距离不变",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L029",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 29,
      "order": 29,
      "text": "D.质量大的滑块加速度大",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L030",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 30,
      "order": 30,
      "text": "6.甲、乙两辆汽车分别在同一平直公路的两条车道上同向行驶，$t=0$ 时刻它们恰好经过同一路标。$0\\sim t_{2}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P1L031",
      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 31,
      "order": 31,
      "text": "第1页/共11页",
      "block_type": "text",
