    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L005",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 36,
      "text": "C.$0\\sim t_{\\mathrm{{p}}}$ 时间内甲车位移大于乙车位移",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L006",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 37,
      "text": "D.$0\\sim t_{2}$ 时间内乙车的平均速度小于$\\frac{v_{_1}+v_{_2}}{2}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L007",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 38,
      "text": "7.随着中国航母事业的发展，舰载机着舰这一“刀尖上的舞蹈”已被我们的飞行员熟练掌握，其关键之一在于成功钩住阻拦索后的减速过程。设想一个简化模型（如图）：航母甲板为水平面，阻拦索两端固定且与甲板平行，舰载机从正中央钩住阻拦索（钩住瞬间绳索即绷紧）。下列关于该减速过程的说法正确的是(",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L008",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 39,
      "text": "O \n\n步\nO",
      "block_type": "figure_placeholder",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L009",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 40,
      "text": "A.舰载机钩住阻拦索继续向前运动的过程中，阻拦索对舰载机的弹力不变",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L010",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 41,
      "text": "B.阻拦索对舰载机的作用力与舰载机对阻拦索的作用力大小相等",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L011",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 42,
      "text": "C.舰载机钩住阻拦索继续向前运动的过程中，舰载机受到向前的冲力",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L012",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 43,
      "text": "D.舰载机落在航母上钩住阻拦索后，只受重力、阻拦索的拉力和航母平面的摩擦力三个力作用",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L013",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 44,
      "text": "8.无人机运输脐橙，有效降低了农产品运出大山的成本。在一次运输中，无人机匀速吊运一筐总质量为\n30kg的脐橙，果筐四角由四根相同的轻绳连接，绳与竖直方向夹角均为45°，且空气阻力可忽略。重力加\n速度g取$10\\mathrm{m}/\\mathrm{s}^{2}$ ，则每根绳的拉力大小为（）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L014",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 45,
      "text": "A.75N",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L015",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 46,
      "text": "B.$75{\\sqrt{2}}\\mathrm{N}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L016",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 47,
      "text": "C.300N",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L017",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 48,
      "text": "D.$150\\sqrt{2}\\mathrm{N}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L018",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 49,
      "text": "9.一辆货车运载着相同规格的圆柱形光滑油桶。在车厢底层油桶平整排列，相互紧贴并被牢牢固定，上层只有一只桶C自由摆放在桶A、B间，随车一起在平直公路上匀速行驶。空桶C的质量为m，重力加速度为g。下列说法正确的是（）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L019",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 50,
      "text": "第2页/共11页",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L001",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 51,
      "text": "A B",
      "block_type": "figure_placeholder",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L002",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 52,
      "text": "A.空桶C受桶A的支持力小于受桶B的支持力",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L003",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 53,
      "text": "B.桶C装满油与装半桶油时所受桶B的支持力方向不同",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L004",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 54,
      "text": "C.若货车以大小为a的加速度向前加速运动，且空桶C相对于桶",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L005",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 55,
      "text": "A、B的位置未发生改变，则桶B对空桶C的支持力大小为$m\\sqrt{a^{2}+g^{2}}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L006",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 56,
      "text": "D.若货车刹车的加速度大小为${\\frac{2}{3}}g$ ·，则空桶C一定会与桶B分离滚向桶A顶端",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L007",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 57,
      "text": "10.动车组列车是我国高端装备制造的代表，其技术水平体现了我国强大的综合国力。下表所示为CRH5型动车组的部分技术参数：",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L008",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 58,
      "text": "<html><body><table><tr><td>参数</td><td>数值</td></tr><tr><td>最高运营速度</td><td>200km/h（约56m/s)</td></tr><tr><td>最高试验速度</td><td>250km/h（约70m/s）</td></tr><tr><td>编组质量</td><td>450t（即 - $4.5\\times10^{5}\\mathrm{k g}$</td></tr><tr><td>启动加速度</td><td>$0.5\\mathrm{m}/\\mathrm{s}^{2}$</td></tr><tr><td>紧急制动距离（制动初速度 200km/h)</td><td>$\\le2000\\mathrm{m}$</td></tr></table></body></html>",
      "block_type": "table",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L009",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 59,
      "text": "根据以上信息，下列说法错误的是（）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L010",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 60,
      "text": "A.动车组启动时，合力大小为$2.25\\times10^{5}\\mathrm{N}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L011",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 61,
      "text": "B.动车组以最高运营速度紧急制动时，平均加速度大小最小值约为$0.78\\mathrm{m}/\\mathrm{s}^{2}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L012",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 62,
      "text": "C.若动车组以相同的制动力刹车，制动初速度加倍时，制动距离也加倍",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L013",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 63,
      "text": "D.若动车组以启动加速度从静止匀加速至最高试验速度，所需时间约为140s",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L014",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 64,
      "text": "二、多项选择题（本题共4小题，每小题4分，共16分。全部选对得4分，选对但不全得2分，错选不得分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L015",
      "page_no": 3,
