      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L002",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 195,
      "text": "(1)mg (3分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L003",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 196,
      "text": "(2)$F=m g\\tan37^{\\circ}=1.5N$ (2分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L004",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 197,
      "text": "（3）由力的合成分解可知$F=mg\\tan\\theta,\\quad T=\\frac{mg}{\\cos\\theta}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L005",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 198,
      "text": "F增大，θ增大，轻绳与竖直方向夹角增大，轻绳拉力T增大(4分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L006",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 199,
      "text": "19.（9分）解：",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L007",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 200,
      "text": "（1）由牛顿第二定律及运动学规律$a_{1}=\\mu g,\\quad0-v_{1}^{2}=-2a_{1}x_{1}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L008",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 201,
      "text": "解得_$v_{1}=9\\mathrm{m/s}=",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L009",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 202,
      "text": "32.4\\mathrm{km/h}$ ，可知没有超速。(3分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L010",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 203,
      "text": "（2）由牛顿第二定律及运动学规律$a_{2}=g\\tan17^{\\circ},\\quad v_{1}^{2}-v_{2}^{2}=-2a_{2}x_{2}$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L011",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 204,
      "text": "解得_$v_{2}=15\\mathrm{m/s}=54\\mathrm{km/h}$ ，可知已超速。(3分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L012",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 205,
      "text": "（3）由牛顿第二定律及运动学规律$f-mg\\sin6^{\\circ}=ma_{3},\\quad v_{2}^{2}-v_{3}^{2}=-2a_{3}x_{3}$ 解得$f=10633\\mathrm{N}$ ，可知刹车正常。(3分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L013",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 206,
      "text": "20.（11分）解：",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L014",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 207,
      "text": "（1）由平衡条件可得$f=F\\sin\\theta$ (2分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L015",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 208,
      "text": "（2）小包裹的速度$v_{2}$ 大于传送带的速度$v_{1}$ ，所以小包裹受到传送带的摩擦力方向沿传送带向上，根据牛顿第二定律可知$\\mu mg\\cos\\theta-mg\\sin\\theta=ma$ ，解得$a=0.4m/s^{2}$ (1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L016",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 209,
      "text": "小包裹开始阶段在传送带上做匀减速直线运动，所用时间",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L017",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 210,
      "text": "t_{1}=\\frac{v_{2}-v_{1}}{a}=2.5\\mathrm{s}",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L018",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 211,
      "text": "(1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L019",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 212,
      "text": "在传送带上滑动的距离为",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L020",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 213,
      "text": "x_{1}=\\frac{v_{1}+v_{2}}{2}t_{1}=2.75m",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L021",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 214,
      "text": "(1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L022",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 215,
      "text": "因为小包裹所受滑动摩擦力大于重力沿传送带方向上的分力，即$\\mu m g\\cos\\theta>m g\\sin\\theta$ 所以小包裹与传送带共速后做匀速直线运动至传送带底端，匀速运动的时间为",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L023",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 216,
      "text": "t_{2}=\\frac{L-x_{1}}{v_{1}}=2\\mathrm{s}",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L024",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 24,
      "order": 217,
      "text": "(1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L025",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 25,
      "order": 218,
      "text": "所以小包裹通过传送带的时间为$t=t_{1}+t_{2}=4.5s$ (1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L026",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 26,
      "order": 219,
      "text": "（3）设平板及长柱底面与水平面的夹角为，字典在平板上受到的最大静摩擦力$f_{1}=\\mu m g\\cos\\varphi$ (1分)长柱体侧面给字典的支持力的合力$F_{\\mathrm{N}}=mg\\cos\\varphi$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L027",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 27,
      "order": 220,
      "text": "长柱体两侧面给字典的支持力相等$F_{\\mathrm{N}1}=F_{\\mathrm{N}2},2F_{\\mathrm{N}1}\\cos\\theta=F_{\\mathrm{N}}$ (1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L028",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 28,
      "order": 221,
      "text": "字典受到长柱体的最大静摩擦力$f_{2}=2\\mu F_{\\mathrm{N l}}$ (1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P10L029",
      "page_no": 10,
      "line_no_in_page": 29,
      "order": 222,
      "text": "第10页/共11页",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P11L001",
      "page_no": 11,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 223,
      "text": "可得$\\frac{f_{1}}{f_{2}}=\\cos\\theta$ （1分）（或得出$\\frac{f_{2}}{f_{1}}=\\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$ 亦可）(1分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P11L002",
      "page_no": 11,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 224,
      "text": "第11页/共11页",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3"
    }
  ]
}